case bad-ack-shapes
desc malformed acknowledgements are problems, never acks
recv system TBM:ACTION_ACK|follow|party|3|-|extra
recv system TBM:ACTION_ACK|follow|party|many|-
recv system TBM:ACTION_ACK|follow|everyone|3|-
recv system TBM:ACTION_ERR|pull||No code.
expect ack.count 0
expect err.count 0
expect problems.count 4
expect problem.0 field-count
expect problem.1 bad-number
expect problem.2 bad-scope
expect problem.3 empty-field
